    },
    "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Every source file must match its retained crate archive and Cargo checksum evidence. Modified, unverified or credential-bearing crates are blocked. Archives, registry indexes, installed tools and configuration are retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Every source file must match its retained crate archive and Cargo checksum evidence. Modified, unverified or credential-bearing crates are blocked. Archives, registry indexes, installed tools and configuration are retained."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Cargo、rustc 和 rust-analyzer。每个源文件都必须与保留的包归档及 Cargo 校验信息一致。已修改、未核验或包含凭据的包会被阻止。保留包归档、软件源索引、已安装工具和配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Generated source is allowed only inside verified build-script OUT_DIR after Git and process checks. Preserve manual edits, custom deliverables and files that cannot be rebuilt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Cargo, rustc and rust-analyzer first. Generated source is allowed only inside verified build-script OUT_DIR after Git and process checks. Preserve manual edits, custom deliverables and files that cannot be rebuilt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Cargo、rustc 和 rust-analyzer。通过 Git 和进程检查后，仅可清理已核验构建脚本 OUT_DIR 内的生成源码。请保留手动修改、自定义交付物和无法重新构建的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Swift builds first. Only verified debug or release product directories are targeted; source checkouts, repositories, credentials and package configuration are retained. Preserve custom products and manual edits to generated source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High risk: review and select explicitly. Stop Swift builds first. Only verified debug or release product directories are targeted; source checkouts, repositories, credentials and package configuration are retained. Preserve custom products and manual edits to generated source."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高风险：请逐项审阅并明确选择，先停止 Swift 构建。仅清理已核验的 debug 或 release 产物目录；保留依赖源码、仓库、凭据和包配置。请保留自定义产物及生成源码中的手动修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
